title: Test: German Advance
subtitle: Test scene for the NPC attack AI
tags: event
view-if: german_offensive_timer = 0
on-arrival: {! 
  Q.german_offensive_timer += 1; 
  window.mapNpcTurn('germany');
!}

The German Empire reviews its lines. Wherever a neighbouring province looks clearly weaker than the army facing it, the order is given to advance.

Any attacks have been queued on the map (red arrows) and will be fought when the turn ends.

- @root: Continue
